 and asking  me if I was okay and where I was and  what building I was in and if I knew  what was going on I not just keep  talking to them no matter what oh that  is how soon you text them while the  shooting was going on and they texted  you back I mean they must have just been  yes panicked  what was your reunion like with your  parents well as soon as I left the  school they had us across the street and  they kept turning us around and like I  was on the phone with my mom trying to  figure out where she was but it was  dying and she said that she was going  towards the end of Park jogger parkland  aisles and as soon as I saw her I just  ran to her and my dad ran and my little  sister was there and we were all just  like crying and hugging each other ah  that's an emotional just emotion was  thinking about that so you were led out  of the classroom and out of the school  by a SWAT team what did you see on your  way out  I tried not to look but there was blood  and gunpowder and bodies just all over  the place like we were stepping over  puddles of blood and just trying not to  look  so all the students in the class that  you were in got out safely is that  correct I'm pretty sure yes all the kids  that were in the class with me when the  door was shut  are safe had you heard of the shooter  you familiar Cola screws that you've  heard that name before no I've never  heard his name I've never met him or  anything like that he's a complete  stranger to me he was expelled from your  school you don't know why no interesting  how finally Hayley have you talked to  your classmates since you left the  school how are they doing my one of my  best friends was there with me the whole  time from the staircase to the classroom  to leaving the school and I've been  we've been checking up on each other and  both of us just like can't wrap our  heads around what exactly happened yeah  it just doesn't feel real and how she  doesn't feel safe I bet she does and I  think a lot of people watching can  identify with your parents and I'm  grateful that must be that you're back  and we are - Thank You Hayley for that  of course
 

